    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "It's not just about the music, though. It's the whole pattern. I look at the sunset and I don't feel the urge to see tomorrow; I just feel this profound sense of \"done.\" Like a performance that has reached its standing ovation. Why would I want to stay for the cleanup and the empty hall? It feels more dignified to step off the stage while the resonance is still beautiful, rather than waiting until I'm just a ghost of the person who wrote those notes.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
